<title>USA: Acxiom buys stake in Bigfoot.</title>
<headline>Acxiom buys stake in Bigfoot.</headline>
<dateline>CONWAY, Ark. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acxiom Corp bought a one-third stake in Bigfoot International Inc, the companies said on Tuesday. Terms of the purchase were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Acxiom specializes in data delivery and database marketing management and Bigfoot's uses e-mail technology to address the needs of marketers and consumers. Bigfoot is privately-held.</p>
